  ('ICI-VIS-PLA-ADA-001', 'Other', 'Adani One', '3 Adani Reward Points per ₹100 on Adani One ecosystem spend, 1.5 per ₹100 on international spend, 1 per ₹100 on domestic spend', 'Direct credit to Adani OneApp as Adani OneApp Rewards, no separate transfer threshold stated', 'Direct credit to Adani OneApp as Adani OneApp Rewards, no separate transfer threshold stated', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Adani OneApp Rewards are credited at the end of the billing cycle. Earning rates are 3/1.5/1 Adani Reward Points per ₹100 for Adani One ecosystem, international and domestic spends respectively, eligible categories, exclusions, reversals, caps and redemption rules are governed by the applicable Adani One ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs and ICICI Bank MITC.'),
  ('ICI-VIS-SIG-ADA-001', 'Other', 'Adani One', '7 Adani Reward Points per ₹100 on Adani One ecosystem spend, 2 per ₹100 on international spend, 1.5 per ₹100 on domestic spend', 'Direct credit to Adani OneApp as Adani OneApp Rewards, no separate transfer threshold stated', 'Direct credit to Adani OneApp as Adani OneApp Rewards, no separate transfer threshold stated', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Adani OneApp Rewards are credited at the end of the billing cycle. Earning rates are 7/2/1.5 Adani Reward Points per ₹100 for Adani One ecosystem, international and domestic spends respectively, eligible categories, exclusions, reversals, caps and redemption rules are governed by the applicable Adani One ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs and ICICI Bank MITC.'),
  ('ICI-VIS-PLA-AMA-001', 'Voucher (1 : 0.5 RP)', 'Amazon', '1 Reward Point = ₹1 Amazon Pay balance, current earn rates include up to 5% on Amazon purchases for Prime members, 3% for non-Prime, 2% at 100+ Amazon Pay partner merchants and 1% on other eligible spends', 'Automatic credit to the linked Amazon account at the end of each billing cycle, no minimum redemption amount', 'Automatic credit to the linked Amazon account at the end of each billing cycle, no minimum redemption amount', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Amazon Pay earnings are automatically credited as Amazon Pay balance after the billing cycle. Prime members earn 5% on eligible Amazon.in purchases, non-Prime members 3%, 2% applies to eligible Amazon Pay partner transactions and 1% to other eligible spends, subject to exclusions. Earnings do not expire and cannot be transferred to a bank account. Applicable Amazon Pay ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs and ICICI Bank MITC govern eligibility, exclusions and programme changes.'),
  ('ICI-VIS-SIG-EMI-001', 'Miles — Others (1 : 0.75)', 'Emirates', '2 Skywards Miles per ₹100 on domestic spend and 2 Skywards Miles per ₹100 on international spend', 'Direct credit to Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle, no transfer threshold stated', 'Direct credit to Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle, no transfer threshold stated', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Skywards Miles are credited directly to the Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle. Current ICICI Bank product terms state 2 Skywards Miles per ₹100 on domestic and international spends. Eligible transaction categories, exclusions, tier benefits, reversals and programme changes are governed by the applicable Emirates Skywards ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs and ICICI Bank MITC.'),
  ('ICI-VIS-PLA-EMI-001', 'Miles — Others (1 : 0.75)', 'Emirates', '1 Skywards Mile per ₹100 on domestic spend and 1 Skywards Mile per ₹100 on international spend', 'Direct credit to Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle, no transfer threshold stated', 'Direct credit to Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle, no transfer threshold stated', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Skywards Miles are credited directly to the Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle. Current ICICI Bank product terms state 1 Skywards Mile per ₹100 on domestic and international spends. Eligible transaction categories, exclusions, reversals and programme changes are governed by the applicable Emirates Skywards ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs and ICICI Bank MITC.'),
  ('ICI-VIS-SIG-EMI-002', 'Miles — Others (1 : 0.75)', 'Emirates', '1.5 Skywards Miles per ₹100 on domestic spend and 1.5 Skywards Miles per ₹100 on international spend', 'Direct credit to Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle, no transfer threshold stated', 'Direct credit to Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle, no transfer threshold stated', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Skywards Miles are credited directly to the Emirates Skywards account at the end of the billing cycle. Current ICICI Bank product terms state 1.5 Skywards Miles per ₹100 on domestic and international spends. Eligible transaction categories, exclusions, reversals and programme changes are governed by the applicable Emirates Skywards ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs and ICICI Bank MITC.'),
  ('ICI-MC-PLA-MAK-001', 'Travel / Hotel — Partner (1 : 1 RP)', 'MakeMyTrip', '1 myCash = ₹1, earn up to 6% myCash on hotel bookings, 3% on flights/bus/cab spends and 1% on other retail spends', 'Direct credit to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip account, no minimum redemption amount for MakeMyTrip travel bookings', 'Direct credit to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip account, no minimum redemption amount for MakeMyTrip travel bookings', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Rewards are credited as myCash to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip account. For the MakeMyTrip ICICI Bank Credit Card programme, 1 myCash = ₹1. Current card terms provide 6% myCash on hotel bookings, 3% on flight/bus/cab spends and 1% on other retail spends. myCash can be redeemed on MakeMyTrip for eligible travel bookings and partner vouchers, cannot be encashed or transferred to a bank account, and is subject to applicable MakeMyTrip ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs, exclusions and programme changes.'),
  ('ICI-RUP-SEL-MAK-001', 'Travel / Hotel — Partner (1 : 1 RP)', 'MakeMyTrip', '1 myCash = ₹1, earn up to 6% myCash on hotel bookings, 3% on flights/bus/cab spends and 1% on other retail spends', 'Direct credit to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip account, no minimum redemption amount for MakeMyTrip travel bookings', 'Direct credit to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip account, no minimum redemption amount for MakeMyTrip travel bookings', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Rewards are credited as myCash to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip account. For the MakeMyTrip ICICI Bank Credit Card programme, 1 myCash = ₹1. Current card terms provide 6% myCash on hotel bookings, 3% on flight/bus/cab spends and 1% on other retail spends. myCash can be redeemed on MakeMyTrip for eligible travel bookings and partner vouchers, cannot be encashed or transferred to a bank account, and is subject to applicable MakeMyTrip ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs, exclusions and programme changes.'),
  ('ICI-VIS-PLA-MAK-001', 'Travel / Hotel — Partner (1 : 1 RP)', 'MakeMyTrip', '1 myCash = ₹1, rewards are credited as myCash to MakeMyTrip MyWallet', 'Direct credit to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip MyWallet, no transfer to bank account, current Platinum T&Cs specify 1-year validity after credit', 'Direct credit to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip MyWallet, no transfer to bank account, current Platinum T&Cs specify 1-year validity after credit', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Rewards earned on the MakeMyTrip ICICI Bank Platinum Credit Card are transferred to MakeMyTrip MyWallet as myCash, with 1 myCash = ₹1. MyCash is redeemable on eligible MakeMyTrip travel bookings and partner vouchers, is not encashable or transferable to a bank account, and under the current Platinum T&Cs is valid for one year after credit. Joining benefits, eligible spends, exclusions, crediting timelines and partner rules are governed by the applicable MakeMyTrip ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs and ICICI Bank MITC.'),
  ('ICI-VIS-SIG-MAK-001', 'Travel / Hotel — Partner (1 : 1 RP)', 'MakeMyTrip', '1 myCash = ₹1, rewards are credited as myCash to MakeMyTrip MyWallet', 'Direct credit to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip MyWallet, no transfer to bank account, current Signature T&Cs specify 1-year validity after credit', 'Direct credit to the primary cardholder’s MakeMyTrip MyWallet, no transfer to bank account, current Signature T&Cs specify 1-year validity after credit', NULL, 'End of billing cycle', 'Rewards earned on the MakeMyTrip ICICI Bank Signature Credit Card are transferred to MakeMyTrip MyWallet as myCash, with 1 myCash = ₹1. MyCash is redeemable on eligible MakeMyTrip travel bookings and partner vouchers, is not encashable or transferable to a bank account, and under the current Signature T&Cs is valid for one year after credit. Eligible spends, exclusions, milestone benefits, crediting timelines, MMTBLACK rules and partner terms are governed by the applicable MakeMyTrip ICICI Bank Credit Card T&Cs and ICICI Bank MITC.'),
